                <ITEXT CH="Anti-Oughtiplus Sex!"/>
                <trail ALIGN="1"/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="392.788027433628" YPOS="201.706194690265" OwnPage="0" ItemID="214767520" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="306.470771268674" HEIGHT="598.300884955752" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="1" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L306.471 0 L306.471 598.301 L0 598.301 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L306.471 0 L306.471 598.3 L0 598.3 L0 0 Z" gXpos="392.788027433628" gYpos="201.706194690265" gWidth="289.364104195394" gHeight="311.572338016109" PSTYLE="Default Paragraph Style" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" LANGUAGE="en_US"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Surely Jack's Son"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" CH="Anent Nought"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Halfpast hush, window rainrattled, the lampwick whispering made a little sun of her undone cuff. May I? Me: aye: wristward, thurstward, tictactile, hisher pulse and the twobeat beast becoming, tictactile. Grab!tation: now a conjugal third."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    [He’s barely grabbed her wrist?! At this pace, we’ll need a second issue for the left breast."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Cut the “tictactile”; you can’t time slow reader … but you sure can measure word count! I have eight pages, and one of them is reserved for a Pabst Blue Ribbon ad (now there’s indulgence! Hooch, not words, m’boy.)]"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="His mouth neared hers under the eye of Ought (for all our actions are judged by Him?), starchcollared, kantankerous, apriapriest of the can’tigorical impervertative, conducting an inchquisition with the ruler of heaven. She, inconveniently a posteriori, declined his declension by kissing the other, lesser, sexier man into the indicative. Habeas corpus! Corpus delecti!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    [Name the men each part references. With two men and too much Latin, I can’t tell who gets the tongue. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Cut the little God question; He has His own book."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Tell the dick cop to knock, and have him double check his ruler twice. I once met a guy who measured his rod from the back of his neck. If God grades like that, I want my math tests back!]"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="The room uncounted: rain quicksilvered, pipes groanpsalmed, wick sootgold-hallelujahed. Five fingers found, grounded five; ten attempted the last fastening and encountered the Brastille, final bastion of the proper-tied. Thesis, antithesis, synthease! She laughed: Ribellion!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="     [Keep him losing to the bra; trim the bits that make me lose the sentence. I like seeing him sweat, but I shouldn’t need a map to find the tits.]"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Their lips adjourned; their case did not. Her cuff reclasped, his hand released its hold, he holding nothing against her. Her May must retain mayn’t, his holding its let-go, their concurrence the right to differ. Could they come apart without coming undone, or did each conjunction convey an estate in fee-simple flesh?"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    [I need to know when they fucked. If they didn’t, give him a sock to find while she gets dressed.]"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Proposition: Desire is production, of potential and the real, rather than lack. No Lacan’tian holeyghost haunting the organon, no private privation awaiting its plug-in saviour. Deleuzionally speaking, there is no hole to be made whole; there is a factory, and the sheets have entered the means of reproduction."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    [His dick has a job now? Great, just great. It sleeps all day, stands up for three minutes, and leaves a mess for someone else. I bet his dad got it the job."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Give it a tiny desk, but make it pay for the tightie-whities.]"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Demonstration: Two bodies are an assemblagestalt, not an indivisible One, nor One consuming the Other into an I.O.Uterus. No Hegelateral merger, no adverse copossession. To increase freedom is a joyful composition; to decrease either’s is a hostile takeover by the phallustate."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    [Do his balls count as one, two, zero? They just hang around and agree with the dick. And if he (He?) starts counting sperm, tell him we do not have that kind of space.]"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Scholium: Ought prejudged the kiss by a Good existing before goodness, apriorganizing the lips before their meeting could unmake His categories. Neither kiss nor lip is in itself good or bad: only encounters, judged by their power to act. Immanence, not Hymenence; a conatus, not a can’t-us. Quod erot desirandum."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    [Cut this in half; my dick is soft again.]"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Ought thus unrobed. Beneath the robe: a conference lanyard, publish-or-perish the thought. Desire had produced a paper, a generously endowed chair, a funded inaugural intercourse on emancipation. When the bodies petitioned for a say in their citation, he denounced consentorship and claimed academic freedominion."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    [He got a grant to watch people fuck? I got thrown out of a hotel for that, and I had a room key. Anyways, we’ll run it as a joint piece. Put my name first.]"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
